WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.385
Start a new empty ChatGPT Work chat. (3× speed)

00:00:00.385 --> 00:00:01.201
Choose the workshop book from the computer. (3× speed)

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:01.411
The workshop book is attached. (3× speed)

00:00:01.411 --> 00:00:05.908
Write the request using the attached book. (3× speed)

00:00:05.908 --> 00:00:06.680
Select the installed markdown mermaid writing skill. (3× speed)

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:08.781
Read the complete request and selected skill.

00:00:08.781 --> 00:00:09.211
Send the book and the skill request. (3× speed)

00:00:09.211 --> 00:00:09.671
ChatGPT prepares the skill response. (4× speed)

00:00:09.671 --> 00:00:18.913
Inspect the generated training, inference and RAG diagram.

00:00:18.913 --> 00:00:26.678
Edit a label in the native Mermaid source.

00:00:26.678 --> 00:00:27.688
Change the inference label while keeping the diagram structure.

00:00:27.688 --> 00:00:37.627
Change the inference label and check the preview.

00:00:37.627 --> 00:00:42.449
Copy the editable source and keep the matching exported image.

00:00:42.449 --> 00:00:50.056
Check the edited diagram and the visible text alternative.

00:00:50.056 --> 00:00:54.433
Create a link to the completed conversation.

00:00:54.433 --> 00:00:59.159
Inspect the edited Mermaid diagram.

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:00.257
Expand the native Mermaid diagram

00:01:00.257 --> 00:01:03.882
Open the editable Mermaid source

00:01:03.882 --> 00:01:09.167
Return to the preview of the edited diagram
